5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I believe we should ensure our staff and volunteers are well-supported before we choose a theme.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A sentiment, but not a strategy. I am more interested in the actual logistics of delivery and where our previous timelines collapsed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, Shion, always so serious! I think we should focus on what actually brings the people through the doors.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with the need for practicality. We must ensure the gallery space can actually handle whatever we decide to put in it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to find out where all the money goes! Sometimes it just disappears, and I want to solve that mystery!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, your curiosity is wonderful. I shall look into the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing to see who is available.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will examine the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays. Logic dictates we find the friction points.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'll take the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts. Let's see what the public actually loves!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings. We cannot ignore the building's limits.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to look at the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges! I bet that's where the money is hiding!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
